# CharisBuild — the document model behind the visual builder.
#
# Separate from `Charis` on purpose. Charis is what you BUILD WITH: motion and
# material primitives that belong in any Qt Quick app. CharisBuild is what the
# BUILDER is made of, and an app that merely uses the library should never have
# to import a QML serialiser to draw a button.
#
# Both are plain Qt Quick. Neither imports Quickshell.
module CharisBuild

singleton QmlWriter 1.0 QmlWriter.qml
